From: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 23:30:33 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] draft: net: airoha: Add xPON flow offload support

Implement xPON flow offload support in the EcoNet PPE engine. This
allows
GPON flows to be offloaded to hardware by utilizing QDMA descriptors for
GEM/T-CONT metadata, preventing bypass of the CPU PWAN path. Ensure GPON
data frames meet minimum Ethernet payload size requirements by adding
padding for small packets. Cleanup debug prints and redundant register
writes to avoid interfering with DSA special-tagging.

Signed-off-by: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
